# Bastion's gate duty (docs/ERRANDS.md, "Duties"; Missions/Errands/RZ_DutyBastion.c, Gate): whoever
# comes to the barrier stands there to be talked to (RZ_TalkDutyPerson). The working conversation is
# shared (duty.gate.barrier): asking their business is the beat's option 2 (one of its two looks), and
# the three calls are options 3 lift the barrier, 4 turn them back, 5 hold them for the sergeant.
# Some have a word of their own besides, which settles nothing.

conv duty.gate.barrier
for duty:gate
topic "Papers. Then your business."
prio quest
voice bastion

node start
  say? night :: They hold the papers out into the lamplight, at arm's length, and don't come closer than the barrier.
  say They hold the papers out over the barrier, and wait.
  > @business What's your business at the post? -> heard   do call:slot:2
  > @call I've seen enough. -> call

node heard
  say They tell you, and look at the barrier while they do, not at you.
  > @call2 I've seen enough. -> call

node call
  say The barrier's yours to lift.
  > @lift Through you go. -> end   do call:slot:3
  > @turn Turn round. Not today. -> end   do call:slot:4
  > @hold Wait there. The sergeant will see you. -> end   do call:slot:5

conv duty.gate.farmer
for duty:gate:farmer
topic "Same as every week?"
prio flavour
once
voice haven

node start
  say Every week since they put the pole up. I bring the turnips, the cook says they're small, I say they're the only turnips in the valley. We understand each other.
  > @back0 Right. -> hub

conv duty.gate.nurse
for duty:gate:nurse
topic "Where were you nursing?"
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say The district hospital, until the night they locked the ward doors with us on the inside. I was on the inside. I came out of the window. I can show you the scar.
  > @back1 Right. -> hub

conv duty.gate.soldier
for duty:gate:soldier
topic "Which unit?"
prio flavour
once
voice bastion

node start
  say Second company, the bridge detail. What's left of the bridge detail is me. I'm reporting in. Somebody should have, a week ago. I'm the somebody.
  > @back2 Right. -> hub

conv duty.gate.family
for duty:gate:family
topic "How many of you?"
prio flavour
once
voice haven

node start
  say Five on the paper. Four on the road. The paper was written before. I haven't had the heart to cross him out, and I won't, not with a pen, not here.
  > @back3 Right. -> hub

conv duty.gate.priest
for duty:gate:priest
topic "What brings a priest to a post?"
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say Your men die too, Corporal. Somebody ought to say the words over them who isn't the man who has to dig. I'll dig as well, if you like. I've got used to digging.
  > @back4 Right. -> hub

conv duty.gate.girl
for duty:gate:girl
topic "Where are you going alone?"
prio flavour
once
voice plain

node start
  say My mother said to come to the soldiers if anything happened. Something happened. So I came. She said you'd know what to do. Do you know what to do?
  > @back5 Right. -> hub
